        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the world of 1v1 Block Puzzle Battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of real-time matches as you send disruptive attack blocks to your opponent’s board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more lines you clear, the stronger your attacks become. Keep your combo going to stack bigger bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the excitement of multi-line clears that deal massive damage in a single move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>🌟 Why you'll love this game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔸 Real-time 1v1 online battles: Test your skills against friends or players around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Attack block strategy: Every time you clear a line, send a random garbage block to your opponent’s field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔸 Combo system: Keep clearing lines on consecutive turns without breaking to increase your combo and prepare stronger attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Multi-line clears: Clear multiple lines at once for a huge attack bonus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔸 Offline mode supported: Practice alone or battle AI bots anytime, anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>💥 Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic placement and clearing on an 8x8 puzzle board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple rules with deep tactical battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends for 1v1 matches using special codes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic matchmaking to battle players worldwide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully playable offline without Wi-Fi.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>🎮 How to Play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag blocks onto the 8x8 grid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete full rows or columns to clear them and gain attack points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send attack blocks to your opponent’s board to claim victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your combo going or aim for multi-line clears to unleash powerful attacks. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Tips!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use one of your three blocks to maintain your combo without breaking it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the other two blocks to prepare even stronger attacks!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 Download now and experience the ultimate 1v1 block puzzle battle of strategy and speed!</p>",
